WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:15.241
Vinnie and Mandy followed the boy out of the storage room and through another door.

2
00:00:15.242 --> 00:00:19.127
"Whoa!" Vinnie exclaimed.

3
00:00:19.128 --> 00:00:23.992
They were in a large, spacious room with a high ceiling.

4
00:00:23.993 --> 00:00:29.611
In one corner, sunlight poured into the room through big windows.

5
00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:35.068
Young artists sat looking at a woman posing in a red robe.

6
00:00:35.069 --> 00:00:38.791
They made sketches of her in their notebooks.

7
00:00:38.792 --> 00:00:43.922
In another part of the room, some boys were painting shields.

8
00:00:43.923 --> 00:00:46.512
Others were painting chests.

9
00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:50.039
The workshop was busy with activity.

10
00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:56.085
"Hey, Leo, who are your friends?" asked a boy with dark hair.

11
00:00:56.086 --> 00:00:58.234
He came up to them.

12
00:00:58.235 --> 00:01:01.555
He had some blue paint on his cheek.

13
00:01:01.556 --> 00:01:05.382
Vinnie and Mandy introduced themselves.

14
00:01:05.383 --> 00:01:08.979
"My name is Sandro," said the boy.

15
00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:11.648
Then he turned to his friend.

16
00:01:11.649 --> 00:01:15.474
"You know the rules, Leo," said Sandro.

17
00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:18.348
"Work to create and create to work.

18
00:01:18.349 --> 00:01:20.697
That means no visitors.

19
00:01:20.698 --> 00:01:25.140
If Master Verrocchio finds out, you're in trouble."

20
00:01:25.141 --> 00:01:28.886
"They are new to Florence," replied Leo.

21
00:01:28.887 --> 00:01:31.897
"I promised to show them around.

22
00:01:31.898 --> 00:01:34.694
I'm sure the master won't mind."

23
00:01:34.695 --> 00:01:42.482
"Florence?" Mandy shouted, clapping her hands loudly.

24
00:01:42.483 --> 00:01:46.006
She had always wanted to visit Italy.

25
00:01:46.007 --> 00:01:49.867
Several people stopped and looked at her.

26
00:01:49.868 --> 00:01:55.462
"Mandy, people are staring at you," Vinnie whispered.

27
00:01:55.463 --> 00:01:59.689
Suddenly everyone turned to look at the door.

28
00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:02.830
A tall, older man came in.

29
00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:07.354
He was dressed in a black robe that covered a blue tunic.

30
00:02:07.355 --> 00:02:10.023
He wore a black hat.

31
00:02:10.024 --> 00:02:15.265
"Why am I hearing talking and not creating?" he asked loudly.

32
00:02:15.266 --> 00:02:23.314
"Master Verrocchio? Our new student here has brought some friends to visit," said Sandro.

33
00:02:23.315 --> 00:02:27.402
"Is that so?" Master Verrochhio said.

34
00:02:27.403 --> 00:02:29.639
He walked over to them.

35
00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:32.523
"I was just outside the workshop.

36
00:02:32.524 --> 00:02:35.218
I didn't see anyone come in.

37
00:02:35.219 --> 00:02:37.427
How did you get inside?"

38
00:02:37.428 --> 00:02:40.194
He glared at the children.

39
00:02:40.195 --> 00:02:43.823
Before they could answer, Leo said,

40
00:02:43.824 --> 00:02:47.201
"Sir, I take full responsibility for them.

41
00:02:47.202 --> 00:02:48.949
They were lost.

42
00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:51.203
I thought I could help them."

43
00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:55.832
Master Verrocchio's face softened as he looked at Leo.

44
00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:59.746
"Did you finish the drafts I wanted?" he asked.

45
00:02:59.747 --> 00:03:03.203
Leo handed him a stack of paper.

46
00:03:03.204 --> 00:03:06.667
Master Verrocchio studied the drawings.

47
00:03:06.668 --> 00:03:10.488
To Vinnie, they looked like computer drawings.

48
00:03:10.489 --> 00:03:13.878
The lines were so straight and precise.

49
00:03:13.879 --> 00:03:17.547
Master Verrocchio nodded with approval.

50
00:03:17.548 --> 00:03:20.348
"You have a gift," he said.

51
00:03:20.349 --> 00:03:23.344
"Your talent is already being noticed."

52
00:03:23.345 --> 00:03:27.980
Master Verrocchio handed Leo a soft leather folder.

53
00:03:27.981 --> 00:03:32.073
"Inside are plans for work at the Medici Palace.

54
00:03:32.074 --> 00:03:35.977
The lord's son has requested you to bring them to him."

55
00:03:35.978 --> 00:03:39.535
"But, sir," Sandro protested.

56
00:03:39.536 --> 00:03:42.192
"I was supposed to deliver them."

57
00:03:42.193 --> 00:03:46.625
"Young Lorenzo wants Leo," Master Verrocchio said.

58
00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:49.372
Nodding to Leo, he said,

59
00:03:49.373 --> 00:03:52.880
"Return here after delivering the plans."

60
00:03:52.881 --> 00:03:59.028
"Yes, sir," Leo replied respectfully, taking his notebook and pencil.

61
00:03:59.029 --> 00:04:08.894
Leo bowed and left the workshop with Vinnie and Mandy.
